WEBVTT

00:00:05.458 --> 00:00:06.958
<c.Subtitle-C2_1>I'm sorry.

00:00:06.958 --> 00:00:08.458
<c.Subtitle-C3_1>I know you're very busy.

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:10.166
<c.Subtitle-C4_1>It's all right.

00:00:10.166 --> 00:00:12.166
<c.Subtitle-C5_1>You said you wanted to

00:00:10.167 --> 00:00:12.166
<c.Subtitle-C5_2>show me something?

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:14.875
<c.Subtitle-C6_1>This is it.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.916
<c.Subtitle-C7_1>Do you know who they are?

00:00:23.166 --> 00:00:24.875
<c.Subtitle-C8_1>Yes, I do.

00:00:26.041 --> 00:00:32.958
<c.Subtitle-C9_1>There's Ai, Mai, Mii and

00:00:26.042 --> 00:00:32.958
<c.Subtitle-C9_2>the maid Mea, as well as Unagi.

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:34.791
<c.Subtitle-C10_1>There's no way I could forget.

00:00:34.791 --> 00:00:39.000
<c.Subtitle-C11_1>My mother named me

00:00:34.792 --> 00:00:39.000
<c.Subtitle-C11_2>after this girl, after all.

00:00:39.416 --> 00:00:40.958
<c.Subtitle-C12_1>Right, Mom?

00:00:41.458 --> 00:00:42.500
<c.Subtitle-C13_1>Then...

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:43.541
<c.Subtitle-C14_1>Yes.

00:00:43.541 --> 00:00:46.250
<c.Subtitle-C15_1>I would say your father's theory

00:00:43.542 --> 00:00:46.250
<c.Subtitle-C15_2>is probably right.

00:00:46.916 --> 00:00:49.666
<c.Subtitle-C16_1>But I doubt anyone would believe it.

00:00:49.666 --> 00:00:51.416
<c.Subtitle-C17_1>What kind of people were they?

00:00:51.416 --> 00:00:52.083
<c.Subtitle-C18_1>Huh?

00:00:52.083 --> 00:00:54.500
<c.Subtitle-C19_1>I've never met them.

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:57.041
<c.Subtitle-C20_1>My father met up with them one last time...

00:00:57.041 --> 00:01:00.208
<c.Subtitle-C21_1>...when I was still in my mother's womb.

00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:01.208
<c.Subtitle-C22_1>I see.

00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:05.375
<c.Subtitle-C23_1>Yes. How can I describe them?

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:09.583
<c.Subtitle-C24_1>They're a bit weird, but warm...

00:01:09.583 --> 00:01:12.583
<c.Subtitle-C25_1>...kind, and friendly, and...

00:01:15.125 --> 00:01:17.625
<c.Caption-C2_1>Ai, Ai, Ai, I love you!

00:01:17.791 --> 00:01:20.291
<c.Caption-C3_1>Mai, Mai, Mai, my darling!

00:01:20.416 --> 00:01:23.000
<c.Caption-C4_1>Mii, Mii, Mii, help me!

00:01:23.125 --> 00:01:27.375
<c.Caption-C5_1>Popotan! Popotan! Popotan!

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:44.166
<c.Caption-C6_1>Moshimo genki wo nakushite

00:01:44.625 --> 00:01:46.958
<c.Caption-C7_1>Tohouni kuretatokiniwa

00:01:47.458 --> 00:01:51.000
<c.Caption-C8_1>Popotan no koe wo kikuno

00:01:52.416 --> 00:01:55.083
<c.Caption-C9_1>Souyo anataga sunaoni

00:01:55.250 --> 00:01:57.500
<c.Caption-C10_1>Natte kokoro wo hirakeba

00:01:58.291 --> 00:02:01.875
<c.Caption-C11_1>Popotan wa oshiete kureru

00:02:02.291 --> 00:02:04.666
<c.Caption-C12_1>Anohito wa kuru? Konai?

00:02:04.833 --> 00:02:07.416
<c.Caption-C13_1>Watashi wo suki? Kirai?

00:02:07.541 --> 00:02:10.166
<c.Caption-C14_1>Konokoi wa uso? Honto?

00:02:11.083 --> 00:02:15.333
<c.Caption-C15_1>Donna kotomo shitteruno

00:02:16.291 --> 00:02:18.625
<c.Caption-C16_1>Moudame popopo

00:02:18.916 --> 00:02:21.291
<c.Caption-C17_1>Moudame popopo

00:02:22.166 --> 00:02:27.000
<c.Caption-C18_1>Wakatterukedo yamerarenai

00:02:27.041 --> 00:02:29.416
<c.Caption-C19_1>Moumuri popopo

00:02:29.791 --> 00:02:31.833
<c.Caption-C20_1>Moumuri popopo

00:02:32.708 --> 00:02:37.541
<c.Caption-C21_1>Yume no yumedemo akeramenaide

00:02:37.750 --> 00:02:39.875
<c.Caption-C22_1>Popotan!

00:02:51.375 --> 00:02:52.666
<c.Subtitle-C26_1>She's coming!

00:03:07.875 --> 00:03:09.250
<c.Subtitle-C27_1>Gotcha!

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:14.125
<c.Subtitle-C28_1>How strange.

00:03:14.125 --> 00:03:16.666
<c.Subtitle-C29_1>It seems to be raining

00:03:14.126 --> 00:03:16.666
<c.Subtitle-C29_2>blackboard erasers.

00:03:20.375 --> 00:03:23.500
<c.Subtitle-C30_1>Maybe it's alive?

00:03:24.458 --> 00:03:26.041
<c.Subtitle-C31_1>Good morn...

00:03:26.416 --> 00:03:28.625
<c.Subtitle-C32_1>They're playing tricks on you again?

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:30.250
<c.Subtitle-C33_1>Tricks?

00:03:31.166 --> 00:03:34.916
<c.Subtitle-C34_1>Who did that?! I told you not to

00:03:31.167 --> 00:03:34.916
<c.Subtitle-C34_2>play tricks on Miss Ai!

00:03:35.916 --> 00:03:38.083
<c.Subtitle-C35_1>You're the only one taking her side.

00:03:38.083 --> 00:03:39.500
<c.Subtitle-C36_1>You teacher's pet!

00:03:39.916 --> 00:03:41.041
<c.Subtitle-C37_1>What'd you say?!

00:03:41.958 --> 00:03:44.041
<c.Subtitle-C38_1>Now, now, Daichi.

00:03:44.041 --> 00:03:45.875
<c.Subtitle-C39_1>Don't get so upset.

00:03:45.875 --> 00:03:46.958
<c.Subtitle-C40_1>Look.

00:03:46.958 --> 00:03:49.791
<c.Subtitle-C41_1>Maybe you should be upset about this.

00:03:50.166 --> 00:03:53.583
<c.Subtitle-C42_1>It's because you don't care

00:03:50.167 --> 00:03:53.583
<c.Subtitle-C42_2>that everyone gets into it.

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:55.916
<c.Subtitle-C43_1>I see.

00:03:55.916 --> 00:03:57.250
<c.Subtitle-C44_1>I'm sorry.

00:03:57.458 --> 00:04:00.125
<c.Subtitle-C45_1>Uh, I didn't mean for you to apologize...

00:04:01.291 --> 00:04:03.875
<c.Subtitle-C46_1>Pink and white striped panties!

00:04:04.458 --> 00:04:05.666
<c.Subtitle-C47_1>Hey!

00:04:06.625 --> 00:04:08.791
<c.Subtitle-C48_1>Such an energetic boy.

00:04:09.041 --> 00:04:10.333
<c.Subtitle-C49_1>Like I said...

00:04:10.666 --> 00:04:12.500
<c.Subtitle-C50_1>Don't worry about it.

00:04:12.500 --> 00:04:14.208
<c.Subtitle-C51_1>There's no harm done.

00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:16.333
<c.Subtitle-C52_1>Like I said...

00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:20.250
<c.Subtitle-C53_1>Daichi, go and take your seat.

00:04:20.250 --> 00:04:22.083
<c.Subtitle-C54_1>Let's begin class.

00:04:22.750 --> 00:04:27.750
<c.Caption-C23_1>Popotan

00:04:28.416 --> 00:04:31.416
<c.Subtitle-C55_1>It's almost a year since you

00:04:28.417 --> 00:04:31.416
<c.Subtitle-C55_2>came here as a teacher.

00:04:31.625 --> 00:04:34.125
<c.Subtitle-C56_1>It's about time you took charge.

00:04:34.416 --> 00:04:35.750
<c.Subtitle-C57_1>I suppose.

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:38.125
<c.Subtitle-C58_1>You shouldn't be scolding her like that.

00:04:38.125 --> 00:04:39.583
<c.Subtitle-C59_1>Right, Miss?

00:04:39.583 --> 00:04:42.583
<c.Subtitle-C60_1>Well, I've learned something new.

00:04:42.583 --> 00:04:43.958
<c.Subtitle-C61_1>Like I said...

00:04:43.958 --> 00:04:47.250
<c.Subtitle-C62_1>You're not supposed to say

00:04:43.959 --> 00:04:47.250
<c.Subtitle-C62_2>"I've learned something new"...

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:49.291
<c.Subtitle-C63_1>...to your students!

00:04:49.541 --> 00:04:51.125
<c.Subtitle-C64_1>Is that right.

00:04:52.708 --> 00:04:54.291
<c.Subtitle-C65_1>If only Mai were around...

00:04:54.291 --> 00:04:56.166
<c.Subtitle-C66_1>...she'd give you a real talking to.

00:04:57.250 --> 00:05:00.916
<c.Subtitle-C67_1>Hey, isn't she ever going to

00:04:57.251 --> 00:05:00.916
<c.Subtitle-C67_2>come and visit?

00:05:00.916 --> 00:05:03.000
<c.Subtitle-C68_1>Uh, right.

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:07.333
<c.Subtitle-C69_1>The school where Mai enrolled

00:05:03.001 --> 00:05:07.333
<c.Subtitle-C69_2>is in a country very far away.

00:05:08.333 --> 00:05:09.833
<c.Subtitle-C70_1>Right...

00:05:09.833 --> 00:05:11.833
<c.Subtitle-C71_1>Yes, very far.

00:05:14.541 --> 00:05:17.458
<c.Caption-C24_1>Summer

00:05:14.542 --> 00:05:17.458
<c.Caption-C24_2>Sale

00:05:18.416 --> 00:05:20.333
<c.Subtitle-C72_1>Ta-daa!

00:05:21.333 --> 00:05:24.375
<c.Subtitle-C73_1>Entry number 2! Mai!

00:05:25.041 --> 00:05:26.375
<c.Subtitle-C74_1>Wow...

00:05:26.666 --> 00:05:28.541
<c.Subtitle-C75_1>Well? You like it? You like it?

00:05:28.541 --> 00:05:30.041
<c.Subtitle-C76_1>Yeah. More than I thought.

00:05:30.041 --> 00:05:32.750
<c.Subtitle-C77_1>What did you think, then?

00:05:32.750 --> 00:05:34.541
<c.Subtitle-C78_1>That's a secret.

00:05:36.083 --> 00:05:38.458
<c.Subtitle-C79_1>Hey, Konami! Wait!

00:05:39.458 --> 00:05:40.583
<c.Subtitle-C80_1>Mai?

00:05:40.708 --> 00:05:42.041
<c.Subtitle-C81_1>Are you all right?

00:05:43.208 --> 00:05:44.916
<c.Subtitle-C82_1>I'm fine.

00:05:46.666 --> 00:05:48.500
<c.Subtitle-C83_1>What's the matter, Mai?

00:05:49.666 --> 00:05:51.708
<c.Subtitle-C84_1>Are you okay, Miss?

00:05:51.708 --> 00:05:53.166
<c.Subtitle-C85_1>Uh, yeah.

00:05:56.041 --> 00:05:58.958
<c.Subtitle-C86_1>That was your fault, Konami.

00:05:58.958 --> 00:06:02.125
<c.Subtitle-C87_1>I just wanted to try it on.

00:06:03.583 --> 00:06:05.083
<c.Subtitle-C88_1>Sorry.

00:06:05.625 --> 00:06:08.041
<c.Subtitle-C89_1>But I knew you wanted to buy it.

00:06:08.041 --> 00:06:09.041
<c.Subtitle-C90_1>I suppose.

00:06:09.041 --> 00:06:10.666
<c.Subtitle-C91_1>But how strange.

00:06:11.125 --> 00:06:15.458
<c.Subtitle-C92_1>I never thought you really

00:06:11.126 --> 00:06:15.458
<c.Subtitle-C92_2>liked those girly styles.

00:06:15.458 --> 00:06:17.250
<c.Subtitle-C93_1>Hey, do you remember?

00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:18.791
<c.Subtitle-C94_1>When we parted long time ago?

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:22.833
<c.Subtitle-C95_1>Uh, sure...

00:06:22.833 --> 00:06:28.416
<c.Subtitle-C96_1>You held me really tight

00:06:22.834 --> 00:06:28.416
<c.Subtitle-C96_2>like a boy would do.

00:06:28.416 --> 00:06:31.083
<c.Subtitle-C97_1>I felt so reassured back then.

00:06:31.333 --> 00:06:34.375
<c.Subtitle-C98_1>Like I felt this amazing

00:06:31.334 --> 00:06:34.375
<c.Subtitle-C98_2>warmth within me.

00:06:36.291 --> 00:06:41.375
<c.Subtitle-C99_1>So you being so girlish

00:06:36.292 --> 00:06:41.375
<c.Subtitle-C99_2>seems so different.

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:43.583
<c.Subtitle-C100_1>Mai?

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:47.625
<c.Subtitle-C101_1>You've finally found me out, little girl!

00:06:47.625 --> 00:06:52.625
<c.Subtitle-C102_1>I am actually an alien that has

00:06:47.626 --> 00:06:52.625
<c.Subtitle-C102_2>taken the form of Mai!

00:06:53.333 --> 00:06:55.166
<c.Subtitle-C103_1>No way...

00:06:53.334 --> 00:06:55.166
<c.Subtitle-C103_2>We are here to conquer Earth!

00:06:55.166 --> 00:06:57.500
<c.Subtitle-C104_1>We are here to conquer Earth!

00:06:57.500 --> 00:06:59.750
<c.Subtitle-C105_1>Submit to our rule!

00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:02.125
<c.Subtitle-C106_1>Mai, you're so funny!

00:06:59.751 --> 00:07:02.125
<c.Subtitle-C106_2>Submit to our rule!

00:07:05.583 --> 00:07:07.625
<c.Subtitle-C107_1>I'm just the same old me.

00:07:07.625 --> 00:07:11.250
<c.Subtitle-C108_1>So let's not talk about

00:07:07.626 --> 00:07:11.250
<c.Subtitle-C108_2>those times again.

00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:12.250
<c.Subtitle-C109_1>Huh?

00:07:12.250 --> 00:07:16.166
<c.Subtitle-C110_1>It's something I don't like to

00:07:12.251 --> 00:07:16.166
<c.Subtitle-C110_2>think about much.

00:07:17.958 --> 00:07:19.083
<c.Subtitle-C111_1>Let's go.

00:07:19.833 --> 00:07:22.166
<c.Subtitle-C112_1>W-Wait, Mai!

00:07:24.833 --> 00:07:26.000
<c.Subtitle-C113_1>Aww...

00:07:34.375 --> 00:07:36.916
<c.Subtitle-C114_1>I cannot ignore people in trouble!

00:07:37.166 --> 00:07:39.083
<c.Subtitle-C115_1>I'm Magical Girl Mii!

00:07:39.666 --> 00:07:43.083
<c.Subtitle-C116_1>And I'm Magical Priestess Nono!

00:07:43.083 --> 00:07:47.083
<c.Subtitle-C117_1>You can be sure that we can

00:07:43.084 --> 00:07:47.083
<c.Subtitle-C117_2>clean up any mess you make!

00:07:47.291 --> 00:07:50.375
<c.Subtitle-C118_1>Please tell me what's been

00:07:47.292 --> 00:07:50.375
<c.Subtitle-C118_2>troubling you people!

00:07:50.375 --> 00:07:51.416
<c.Subtitle-C119_1>Yeah!

00:07:53.125 --> 00:07:55.875
<c.Subtitle-C120_1>It's cold, Mii.

00:07:55.875 --> 00:07:59.166
<c.Subtitle-C121_1>Why do we have to dress like this?

00:07:59.291 --> 00:08:03.458
<c.Subtitle-C122_1>A Magical Girl must wear

00:07:59.292 --> 00:08:03.458
<c.Subtitle-C122_2>a miniskirt even in winter!

00:08:03.666 --> 00:08:05.000
<c.Subtitle-C123_1>But...!

00:08:06.166 --> 00:08:07.208
<c.Subtitle-C124_1>Snow!

00:08:09.708 --> 00:08:10.833
<c.Subtitle-C125_1>Yay!

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:14.375
<c.Subtitle-C126_1>Yay! It's snowing! It's snowing!

00:08:15.208 --> 00:08:17.458
<c.Subtitle-C127_1>Getting all excited about snow.

00:08:17.916 --> 00:08:19.416
<c.Subtitle-C128_1>What's all the fuss?

00:08:19.833 --> 00:08:22.083
<c.Subtitle-C129_1>Yes, but...

00:08:22.416 --> 00:08:24.833
<c.Subtitle-C130_1>But I'm glad she's much happier.

00:08:24.833 --> 00:08:28.708
<c.Subtitle-C131_1>When she first came,

00:08:24.834 --> 00:08:28.708
<c.Subtitle-C131_2>she would never leave the house.

00:08:30.541 --> 00:08:33.333
<c.Subtitle-C132_1>I hope she really is happy.

00:08:33.666 --> 00:08:34.666
<c.Subtitle-C133_1>Huh?

00:08:36.416 --> 00:08:37.583
<c.Subtitle-C134_1>Yay!

00:08:40.625 --> 00:08:43.208
<c.Subtitle-C135_1>Aww, it's starting to snow.

00:08:43.875 --> 00:08:45.375
<c.Subtitle-C136_1>Mai?

00:08:53.750 --> 00:08:54.791
<c.Subtitle-C137_1>Mii...

00:09:06.958 --> 00:09:08.666
<c.Subtitle-C138_1>Mai!

00:09:09.333 --> 00:09:10.500
<c.Subtitle-C139_1>Hey!

00:09:11.166 --> 00:09:13.166
<c.Subtitle-C140_1>Hey, what do you want?

00:09:14.208 --> 00:09:16.041
<c.Subtitle-C141_1>I think you've got the wrong girl.

00:09:18.166 --> 00:09:19.208
<c.Subtitle-C142_1>Bye!

00:09:27.125 --> 00:09:29.250
<c.Subtitle-C143_1>She looked a lot like Mai.

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:30.375
<c.Subtitle-C144_1>Yeah.

00:09:30.375 --> 00:09:32.333
<c.Subtitle-C145_1>But there's no way she'd be here.

00:09:34.291 --> 00:09:36.333
<c.Subtitle-C146_1>She's really never going to come?

00:09:36.333 --> 00:09:37.375
<c.Subtitle-C147_1>Yeah!

00:09:37.375 --> 00:09:38.916
<c.Subtitle-C148_1>I told you many times.

00:09:39.541 --> 00:09:43.666
<c.Subtitle-C149_1>I used my magical powers

00:09:39.542 --> 00:09:43.666
<c.Subtitle-C149_2>to send them to a place...

00:09:43.666 --> 00:09:46.333
<c.Subtitle-C150_1>...that would make them really happy!

00:09:46.583 --> 00:09:50.958
<c.Subtitle-C151_1>So they're really happy right now.

00:09:51.833 --> 00:09:56.125
<c.Subtitle-C152_1>But you don't seem so happy.

00:09:58.583 --> 00:10:01.083
<c.Subtitle-C153_1>Th-That's not true!

00:10:01.541 --> 00:10:03.250
<c.Subtitle-C154_1>I'm really happy!

00:10:03.250 --> 00:10:07.416
<c.Subtitle-C155_1>I'm so happy being with you

00:10:03.251 --> 00:10:07.416
<c.Subtitle-C155_2>and your grandpa!

00:10:07.958 --> 00:10:11.583
<c.Subtitle-C156_1>I know, Nono!

00:10:07.959 --> 00:10:11.583
<c.Subtitle-C156_2>Let's go and get some cake!

00:10:11.583 --> 00:10:14.583
<c.Subtitle-C157_1>Cake! Let's take our

00:10:11.584 --> 00:10:14.583
<c.Subtitle-C157_2>Magic Powers and go, go, go!

00:10:24.041 --> 00:10:26.958
<c.Subtitle-C158_1>Is this what they truly wanted?

00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:38.000
<c.Subtitle-C159_1>A little longer...

00:10:39.291 --> 00:10:42.458
<c.Subtitle-C160_1>Let's watch over them a little while longer.

00:11:02.291 --> 00:11:05.208
<c.Caption-C25_1>About my teacher...

00:11:02.292 --> 00:11:05.208
<c.Caption-C25_2>By Hanada

00:11:05.208 --> 00:11:08.666
<c.Caption-C26_1>My teacher is always smiling...

00:11:05.250 --> 00:11:07.750
<c.Subtitle-C161_1>Miss! Where do you live, Miss?

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:10.791
<c.Subtitle-C162_1>I live in an apartment in District 2.

00:11:10.791 --> 00:11:12.208
<c.Subtitle-C163_1>What are your hobbies!

00:11:12.416 --> 00:11:15.791
<c.Subtitle-C164_1>Well, I enjoy growing plants.

00:11:15.958 --> 00:11:18.083
<c.Subtitle-C165_1>Hey, hey! Do you have a boyfriend?

00:11:19.875 --> 00:11:22.166
<c.Subtitle-C166_1>Don't ask her that!

00:11:22.166 --> 00:11:24.625
<c.Subtitle-C167_1>Why are you blushing, Daichi?

00:11:40.250 --> 00:11:44.250
<c.Subtitle-C168_1>We're finally able to live a life

00:11:40.251 --> 00:11:44.250
<c.Subtitle-C168_2>where we don't hurt anyone...

00:11:44.250 --> 00:11:46.333
<c.Subtitle-C169_1>...and don't have to hide anything.

00:11:48.791 --> 00:11:51.625
<c.Subtitle-C170_1>I guess you have no more answers for me.

00:11:59.291 --> 00:12:02.000
<c.Subtitle-C171_1>Oh, how strange.

00:12:03.250 --> 00:12:06.208
<c.Subtitle-C172_1>I thought I was happy.

00:12:10.625 --> 00:12:13.541
<c.Subtitle-C173_1>You'll stay by my side forever?

00:12:14.250 --> 00:12:16.208
<c.Subtitle-C174_1>Thank you, Unagi.

00:12:16.583 --> 00:12:19.375
<c.Subtitle-C175_1>Now you're feeling lonely, huh?

00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:28.083
<c.Subtitle-C176_1>Keith...

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:35.083
<c.Subtitle-C177_1>Popotan.

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:40.083
<c.Subtitle-C178_1>Popotan.

00:12:41.041 --> 00:12:42.916
<c.Subtitle-C179_1>It's been a while.

00:12:43.166 --> 00:12:47.000
<c.Subtitle-C180_1>You finally get to end your journey,

00:12:43.167 --> 00:12:47.000
<c.Subtitle-C180_2>so why do you cry?

00:12:48.791 --> 00:12:50.791
<c.Subtitle-C181_1>What are you doing here?

00:12:50.791 --> 00:12:52.458
<c.Subtitle-C182_1>You have no business with me.

00:12:53.625 --> 00:12:55.416
<c.Subtitle-C183_1>You three sisters...

00:12:55.416 --> 00:13:00.416
<c.Subtitle-C184_1>...still think there's a place where

00:12:55.417 --> 00:13:00.416
<c.Subtitle-C184_2>each of you can live the way you want.

00:13:00.416 --> 00:13:02.666
<c.Subtitle-C185_1>But there's no such place.

00:13:03.166 --> 00:13:04.500
<c.Subtitle-C186_1>Oh, yes.

00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:08.291
<c.Subtitle-C187_1>I happened to check in on Mii

00:13:04.501 --> 00:13:08.291
<c.Subtitle-C187_2>before I came here.

00:13:25.875 --> 00:13:27.041
<c.Subtitle-C188_1>She's the same.

00:13:27.666 --> 00:13:29.541
<c.Subtitle-C189_1>She seemed very lonely

00:13:27.667 --> 00:13:29.541
<c.Subtitle-C189_2>in that shrine.

00:13:29.541 --> 00:13:30.708
<c.Subtitle-C190_1>Stop it!

00:13:32.666 --> 00:13:34.166
<c.Subtitle-C191_1>I would say Mai, too, is...

00:13:34.166 --> 00:13:35.333
<c.Subtitle-C192_1>Stop it!

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:36.500
<c.Subtitle-C193_1>Stop!

00:13:37.541 --> 00:13:40.791
<c.Subtitle-C194_1>I was once on a journey as well.

00:13:42.208 --> 00:13:45.875
<c.Subtitle-C195_1>I met many people,

00:13:42.209 --> 00:13:45.875
<c.Subtitle-C195_2>got to know them well...

00:13:45.875 --> 00:13:49.208
<c.Subtitle-C196_1>...then parted and suffered

00:13:45.876 --> 00:13:49.208
<c.Subtitle-C196_2>much sadness...

00:13:49.208 --> 00:13:52.125
<c.Subtitle-C197_1>...as I continued to find

00:13:49.209 --> 00:13:52.125
<c.Subtitle-C197_2>my own place.

00:13:52.125 --> 00:13:54.916
<c.Subtitle-C198_1>But there was no such place.

00:13:56.375 --> 00:14:01.041
<c.Subtitle-C199_1>The greater the hope you have

00:13:56.376 --> 00:14:01.041
<c.Subtitle-C199_2>the greater the disappointment.

00:14:01.916 --> 00:14:03.500
<c.Subtitle-C200_1>That's why...

00:14:05.958 --> 00:14:10.291
<c.Subtitle-C201_1>...I tried to make you realize that

00:14:05.959 --> 00:14:10.291
<c.Subtitle-C201_2>you cannot have too great a hope.

00:14:15.458 --> 00:14:17.291
<c.Subtitle-C202_1>I'll say it again.

00:14:17.708 --> 00:14:20.875
<c.Subtitle-C203_1>There is no place for us in this world.

00:14:21.166 --> 00:14:24.166
<c.Subtitle-C204_1>Whether we continue

00:14:21.167 --> 00:14:24.166
<c.Subtitle-C204_2>the journey, or end it.

00:14:24.208 --> 00:14:25.541
<c.Subtitle-C205_1>Please leave!

00:14:37.708 --> 00:14:39.541
<c.Subtitle-C206_1>Just stop that!

00:14:39.541 --> 00:14:40.541
<c.Subtitle-C207_1>Mai?

00:14:41.416 --> 00:14:43.166
<c.Subtitle-C208_1>I came back here...

00:14:43.166 --> 00:14:45.458
<c.Subtitle-C209_1>...so please don't talk about that again!

00:14:45.541 --> 00:14:46.541
<c.Subtitle-C210_1>Sorry.

00:14:47.458 --> 00:14:50.875
<c.Subtitle-C211_1>Konami, should I not have come back?

00:14:50.958 --> 00:14:51.833
<c.Subtitle-C212_1>No!

00:14:51.833 --> 00:14:52.833
<c.Subtitle-C213_1>Of course not!

00:14:52.875 --> 00:14:54.416
<c.Subtitle-C214_1>I'm very happy you came back.

00:14:54.416 --> 00:14:57.750
<c.Subtitle-C215_1>Then why do you always

00:14:54.417 --> 00:14:57.750
<c.Subtitle-C215_2>want to talk about those times?

00:14:58.833 --> 00:14:59.750
<c.Subtitle-C216_1>Because...

00:15:03.125 --> 00:15:04.250
<c.Subtitle-C217_1>Mai...

00:15:12.833 --> 00:15:15.916
<c.Subtitle-C218_1>So this is it for them, huh?

00:15:19.625 --> 00:15:22.583
<c.Subtitle-C219_1>I don't think they've given up yet.

00:15:34.916 --> 00:15:42.083
<c.Caption-C27_1>Mii's Place

00:15:44.166 --> 00:15:46.833
<c.Subtitle-C220_1>You want me to slave over them again?

00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:52.166
<c.Subtitle-C221_1>No way...

00:15:55.833 --> 00:15:56.916
<c.Subtitle-C222_1>Coming!

00:15:57.875 --> 00:15:59.916
<c.Subtitle-C223_1>Good morning, Miss Ai!

00:16:00.291 --> 00:16:04.291
<c.Subtitle-C224_1>Oh, good morning, Daichi, Asuka!

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:07.375
<c.Subtitle-C225_1>Miss Ai, are you free today?

00:16:07.541 --> 00:16:08.625
<c.Subtitle-C226_1>Uh, yes.

00:16:21.166 --> 00:16:22.500
<c.Subtitle-C227_1>This is...

00:16:22.541 --> 00:16:25.500
<c.Subtitle-C228_1>This is where you and

00:16:22.542 --> 00:16:25.500
<c.Subtitle-C228_2>your sisters lived before.

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:29.541
<c.Subtitle-C229_1>Miss, I hope you can

00:16:25.501 --> 00:16:29.541
<c.Subtitle-C229_2>make up with Mai.

00:16:30.375 --> 00:16:34.875
<c.Subtitle-C230_1>Asuka thinks you must've had

00:16:30.376 --> 00:16:34.875
<c.Subtitle-C230_2>a fight or something with Mai.

00:16:35.333 --> 00:16:38.708
<c.Subtitle-C231_1>That's why she says Mai

00:16:35.334 --> 00:16:38.708
<c.Subtitle-C231_2>doesn't come and visit.

00:16:39.250 --> 00:16:40.500
<c.Subtitle-C232_1>Asuka...

00:16:40.750 --> 00:16:45.083
<c.Subtitle-C233_1>I don't know what

00:16:40.751 --> 00:16:45.083
<c.Subtitle-C233_2>kind of person Mai is...

00:16:45.083 --> 00:16:48.083
<c.Subtitle-C234_1>...but I think that you two

00:16:45.084 --> 00:16:48.083
<c.Subtitle-C234_2>should make up.

00:16:48.541 --> 00:16:50.458
<c.Subtitle-C235_1>She is your sister, after all.

00:16:52.750 --> 00:16:54.333
<c.Subtitle-C236_1>Thank you.

00:16:54.750 --> 00:16:56.708
<c.Subtitle-C237_1>I appreciate your concern.

00:16:57.208 --> 00:16:58.708
<c.Subtitle-C238_1>Am I wrong?

00:16:58.708 --> 00:17:02.500
<c.Subtitle-C239_1>Well, it's not that we had a fight.

00:17:02.875 --> 00:17:06.541
<c.Subtitle-C240_1>It's just that we decided

00:17:02.876 --> 00:17:06.541
<c.Subtitle-C240_2>not to see each other again.

00:17:06.791 --> 00:17:07.958
<c.Subtitle-C241_1>Mii, too?

00:17:08.875 --> 00:17:10.000
<c.Subtitle-C242_1>Yes...

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:11.000
<c.Subtitle-C243_1>Why?

00:17:11.666 --> 00:17:15.833
<c.Subtitle-C244_1>We'd been on a journey

00:17:11.667 --> 00:17:15.833
<c.Subtitle-C244_2>for a very long time.

00:17:19.416 --> 00:17:24.208
<c.Subtitle-C245_1>On that journey we were always

00:17:19.417 --> 00:17:24.208
<c.Subtitle-C245_2>forced to leave the people we met...

00:17:24.208 --> 00:17:26.125
<c.Subtitle-C246_1>...even if they were good friends.

00:17:26.875 --> 00:17:31.666
<c.Subtitle-C247_1>We always ended up making

00:17:26.876 --> 00:17:31.666
<c.Subtitle-C247_2>someone feel sad in the end.

00:17:33.250 --> 00:17:36.833
<c.Subtitle-C248_1>That's why we decided to

00:17:33.251 --> 00:17:36.833
<c.Subtitle-C248_2>end the journey.

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:43.958
<c.Subtitle-C249_1>And we each chose to pursue

00:17:39.001 --> 00:17:43.958
<c.Subtitle-C249_2>our own way of living.

00:17:43.958 --> 00:17:45.458
<c.Subtitle-C250_1>But that's not right.

00:17:46.208 --> 00:17:49.250
<c.Subtitle-C251_1>I was always envious about

00:17:46.209 --> 00:17:49.250
<c.Subtitle-C251_2>how you all lived.

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:51.250
<c.Subtitle-C252_1>It always seemed so fun...

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:54.333
<c.Subtitle-C253_1>...and everyone got along

00:17:51.251 --> 00:17:54.333
<c.Subtitle-C253_2>in your house.

00:17:54.375 --> 00:17:58.833
<c.Subtitle-C254_1>It was like I got a lot of energy

00:17:54.376 --> 00:17:58.833
<c.Subtitle-C254_2>and cheer from you people.

00:17:59.083 --> 00:18:01.958
<c.Subtitle-C255_1>That's when I was reminded

00:17:59.084 --> 00:18:01.958
<c.Subtitle-C255_2>of the time you left.

00:18:01.958 --> 00:18:05.291
<c.Subtitle-C256_1>I thought of you as people...

00:18:05.291 --> 00:18:09.125
<c.Subtitle-C257_1>...who travel around and bring

00:18:05.292 --> 00:18:09.125
<c.Subtitle-C257_2>happiness to people who are sad.

00:18:09.708 --> 00:18:11.166
<c.Subtitle-C258_1>I thought you were so cool.

00:18:12.166 --> 00:18:13.708
<c.Subtitle-C259_1>It's not like that at all.

00:18:13.750 --> 00:18:16.666
<c.Subtitle-C260_1>I liked the Mai I remember

00:18:13.751 --> 00:18:16.666
<c.Subtitle-C260_2>from that time.

00:18:17.541 --> 00:18:20.250
<c.Subtitle-C261_1>Even if what you said then

00:18:17.542 --> 00:18:20.250
<c.Subtitle-C261_2>wasn't the truth...

00:18:20.250 --> 00:18:21.583
<c.Subtitle-C262_1>...I still feel the same.

00:18:22.083 --> 00:18:25.125
<c.Subtitle-C263_1>When I talk about things

00:18:22.084 --> 00:18:25.125
<c.Subtitle-C263_2>from the past...

00:18:25.125 --> 00:18:28.625
<c.Subtitle-C264_1>...it's because I don't want to

00:18:25.126 --> 00:18:28.625
<c.Subtitle-C264_2>change the way I feel about you.

00:18:29.333 --> 00:18:30.166
<c.Subtitle-C265_1>You mustn't...

00:18:30.166 --> 00:18:30.875
<c.Subtitle-C266_1>What?

00:18:31.041 --> 00:18:34.625
<c.Subtitle-C267_1>I mean, you're going to be tied down

00:18:31.042 --> 00:18:34.625
<c.Subtitle-C267_2>for the rest of your life.

00:18:35.333 --> 00:18:36.541
<c.Subtitle-C268_1>Tied down?

00:18:38.333 --> 00:18:41.208
<c.Subtitle-C269_1>My mom became ill two years ago.

00:18:41.916 --> 00:18:46.041
<c.Subtitle-C270_1>Even in the hospital, she kept

00:18:41.917 --> 00:18:46.041
<c.Subtitle-C270_2>talking about her long lost friend.

00:18:47.250 --> 00:18:49.458
<c.Subtitle-C271_1>They had long separated...

00:18:49.458 --> 00:18:53.375
<c.Subtitle-C272_1>...but it was like my mom's spirit

00:18:49.459 --> 00:18:53.375
<c.Subtitle-C272_2>was tied down by that girl.

00:18:54.958 --> 00:18:59.708
<c.Subtitle-C273_1>Back then, I promised that we'd meet

00:18:54.959 --> 00:18:59.708
<c.Subtitle-C273_2>even though I knew we never could!

00:19:02.333 --> 00:19:04.708
<c.Subtitle-C274_1>If I had never come back...

00:19:05.458 --> 00:19:09.416
<c.Subtitle-C275_1>...your spirit would've been

00:19:05.459 --> 00:19:09.416
<c.Subtitle-C275_2>tied down by me from that time.

00:19:09.416 --> 00:19:10.916
<c.Subtitle-C276_1>Forever...

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:12.583
<c.Subtitle-C277_1>You're wrong.

00:19:13.833 --> 00:19:16.458
<c.Subtitle-C278_1>It's not like my spirit is tied down.

00:19:16.458 --> 00:19:19.708
<c.Subtitle-C279_1>I'm not able to forget you

00:19:16.459 --> 00:19:19.708
<c.Subtitle-C279_2>because I've made...

00:19:19.708 --> 00:19:22.625
<c.Subtitle-C280_1>...a special space for you

00:19:19.709 --> 00:19:22.625
<c.Subtitle-C280_2>deep in my heart.

00:19:23.458 --> 00:19:26.958
<c.Subtitle-C281_1>So even though I may never

00:19:23.459 --> 00:19:26.958
<c.Subtitle-C281_2>have seen you again...

00:19:26.958 --> 00:19:29.541
<c.Subtitle-C282_1>...you are always in my heart.

00:19:32.208 --> 00:19:33.708
<c.Subtitle-C283_1>I was a little sad.

00:19:33.708 --> 00:19:37.750
<c.Subtitle-C284_1>But I thought of you as people

00:19:33.709 --> 00:19:37.750
<c.Subtitle-C284_2>who come with the wind...

00:19:37.750 --> 00:19:42.250
<c.Subtitle-C285_1>...and drop seeds that bloom into

00:19:37.751 --> 00:19:42.250
<c.Subtitle-C285_2>flowers in the hearts of people.

00:19:42.250 --> 00:19:44.416
<c.Subtitle-C286_1>Just like the Popotan.

00:19:45.166 --> 00:19:46.083
<c.Subtitle-C287_1>Popotan...

00:20:12.000 --> 00:20:13.333
<c.Subtitle-C288_1>No way...

00:20:15.958 --> 00:20:18.375
<c.Subtitle-C289_1>It's been a while, Miss Ai.

00:20:19.166 --> 00:20:20.166
<c.Subtitle-C290_1>Mea!

00:20:23.666 --> 00:20:24.583
<c.Subtitle-C291_1>Miss Ai!

00:20:31.708 --> 00:20:32.791
<c.Subtitle-C292_1>Thank you.

00:20:39.625 --> 00:20:41.750
<c.Subtitle-C293_1>Take care of Daichi for me.

00:20:41.750 --> 00:20:42.583
<c.Subtitle-C294_1>Okay!

00:20:49.708 --> 00:20:51.958
<c.Subtitle-C295_1>Are you going to continue the journey?

00:20:52.166 --> 00:20:53.125
<c.Subtitle-C296_1>Yes.

00:20:53.125 --> 00:20:55.291
<c.Subtitle-C297_1>You're going to repeat the same thing.

00:20:55.291 --> 00:20:57.875
<c.Subtitle-C298_1>No matter how much you try to search...

00:20:57.875 --> 00:20:58.875
<c.Subtitle-C299_1>No.

00:20:58.875 --> 00:21:01.041
<c.Subtitle-C300_1>There's no need to search any more.

00:21:02.208 --> 00:21:04.166
<c.Subtitle-C301_1>We have found our place.

00:21:04.166 --> 00:21:06.958
<c.Subtitle-C302_1>In the hearts of all those

00:21:04.167 --> 00:21:06.958
<c.Subtitle-C302_2>that we've met.

00:21:07.625 --> 00:21:10.791
<c.Subtitle-C303_1>So we don't need a guide anymore.

00:21:10.791 --> 00:21:14.000
<c.Subtitle-C304_1>Even if it's a journey

00:21:10.792 --> 00:21:14.000
<c.Subtitle-C304_2>that never ends...

00:21:14.041 --> 00:21:16.833
<c.Subtitle-C305_1>...we'll never get lost again.

00:21:17.875 --> 00:21:19.166
<c.Subtitle-C306_1>W-Wait!

00:21:21.791 --> 00:21:23.291
<c.Subtitle-C307_1>Wh-What are you doing?!

00:21:28.791 --> 00:21:32.916
<c.Subtitle-C308_1>My duty is to protect them.

00:21:37.750 --> 00:21:40.666
<c.Subtitle-C309_1>Everyone has a special place.

00:21:41.291 --> 00:21:43.125
<c.Subtitle-C310_1>Even you, I'm sure.

00:22:03.750 --> 00:22:05.541
<c.Subtitle-C311_1>You go, too.

00:22:25.458 --> 00:22:26.916
<c.Subtitle-C312_1>It's all right.

00:22:27.666 --> 00:22:31.416
<c.Subtitle-C313_1>I can always see you when I do this.

00:22:33.333 --> 00:22:34.708
<c.Subtitle-C314_1>That's true.

00:22:35.166 --> 00:22:37.375
<c.Subtitle-C315_1>Well, I'll see you, Konami.

00:23:02.291 --> 00:23:04.208
<c.Subtitle-C316_1>I feel so limp...

00:23:04.416 --> 00:23:06.041
<c.Subtitle-C317_1>Look, Mii!

00:23:32.541 --> 00:23:35.708
<c.Subtitle-C318_1>Ai! Mai!

00:23:55.583 --> 00:23:57.458
<c.Subtitle-C319_1>Like Popotan, huh?

00:23:58.125 --> 00:23:58.916
<c.Subtitle-C320_1>That's right.

00:23:58.916 --> 00:24:01.333
<c.Subtitle-C321_1>We'll never meet again...

00:24:01.333 --> 00:24:04.625
<c.Subtitle-C322_1>...but they continue to bloom

00:24:01.334 --> 00:24:04.625
<c.Subtitle-C322_2>within our hearts.

00:24:04.625 --> 00:24:06.750
<c.Subtitle-C323_1>Like small Popotan.

00:24:07.666 --> 00:24:09.250
<c.Subtitle-C324_1>Popotan, huh?

00:24:10.083 --> 00:24:13.875
<c.Subtitle-C325_1>I heard that Miss Ai was

00:24:10.084 --> 00:24:13.875
<c.Subtitle-C325_2>my dad's first kiss.

00:24:16.750 --> 00:24:20.208
<c.Subtitle-C326_1>Well, is that your type of woman?

00:24:21.791 --> 00:24:23.000
<c.Subtitle-C327_1>Uh, maybe...

00:24:23.583 --> 00:24:25.416
<c.Subtitle-C328_1>Just like your father, huh?

00:24:26.250 --> 00:24:28.875
<c.Subtitle-C329_1>I'd love to meet her one day.

00:24:28.875 --> 00:24:30.541
<c.Subtitle-C330_1>If she's real, that is.

00:24:40.250 --> 00:24:42.041
<c.Subtitle-C331_1>Where are we now?

00:24:42.083 --> 00:24:44.625
<c.Subtitle-C332_1>I wonder if there're any people in trouble?!

00:24:44.625 --> 00:24:46.166
<c.Subtitle-C333_1>I'm unfamiliar with this place.

00:24:46.166 --> 00:24:47.541
<c.Subtitle-C334_1>Anyway, let's go out!

00:24:49.666 --> 00:24:51.250
<c.Subtitle-C335_1>One, two...

00:24:51.625 --> 00:24:53.125
<c.Subtitle-C336_1>Go!

00:25:11.750 --> 00:25:15.041
<c.Caption-C28_1>Tekuno panku de aishitetainoyo

00:25:15.041 --> 00:25:18.541
<c.Caption-C29_1>Denpa ni nosete daisuki suki suki

00:25:18.541 --> 00:25:22.041
<c.Caption-C30_1>Romanchikku wo anatani agetai

00:25:22.041 --> 00:25:23.666
<c.Caption-C31_1>Waratte hoshii

00:25:23.666 --> 00:25:25.458
<c.Caption-C32_1>I love, love, love you

00:25:25.458 --> 00:25:28.708
<c.Caption-C33_1>S.U.K.I. dokidoki love

00:25:28.750 --> 00:25:32.250
<c.Caption-C34_1>S.U.K.I. gimigimi kiss

00:25:32.250 --> 00:25:35.791
<c.Caption-C35_1>S.U.K.I. sukisuki love

00:25:35.791 --> 00:25:39.416
<c.Caption-C36_1>S.U.K.I. sukiari kiss

00:25:39.416 --> 00:25:41.125
<c.Caption-C37_1>Mawaru mawaru

00:25:41.125 --> 00:25:43.041
